00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:51,000
After World War II, Hitler’s deadliest lieutenant escaped.

2
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:36,000
Operation Finale is a drama, history, thriller film directed by Chris Weitz.

3
00:23:15,000 --> 00:23:21,000
In 1960, a team of Israeli secret agents is deployed to find Adolf Eichmann, the infamous Nazi architect
of the Holocaust, supposedly hidden in Argentina, and get him to Israel to be judged.

